ile the plan required by this Act not later than January 5, 2029. A system that has not filed by that date shall report the reason to the department.","operativeEffect":null},{"id":"legislative-provision_8319795bdc39c486","provisionKey":"plan-contents","text":"The plan required by this Act shall contain an inventory identifying the material of each service line in the system and the sequence in which the system would replace them. The department shall publish each filed plan.","operativeEffect":null}]}
